  "content": "<p>Mod由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> 创建 - \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LinkedIn</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Scholar</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文章</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/r4Knci2k/images/7213f4ce1c84436eea0c31e9579395b8f1d6aefe.png\" alt=\"banner_image\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Star on GitHub-fafbfc?logo=github&logoColor=black\" alt=\"star\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ynQvWygqQT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865f2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"discord\"></a> </p>\n<p><strong>Create: Interiors 是一個擴展 Create 家具選項的附加模組，現在同時支援 Forge 和 Fabric！</strong></p>\n<h2>功能列表：</h2>\n<h2>•   椅子方塊</h2>\n<p><em>提供全部 16 種 Minecraft 染色顏色的變體</em></p>\n<p><em>使用扳手右鍵點擊可切換扶手狀態（無、僅左側、僅右側或雙側）</em></p>\n<p><em>可由 1 個染色羊毛和 2 個木製階梯合成，或由 1 個染色坐墊和 1 個木製階梯合成</em></p>\n<p><em>可被乘坐，無論是作為結構的一部分還是獨立放置均可</em></p>\n<p><em>可以像坐墊方塊一樣拾取實體</em></p>\n<p><em>具有彈性！</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k1JDWLC/resized-colors.gif\" alt=\"chair_colors\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bJs9sQr/resized-armrests.gif\" alt=\"chair_armrests\"></p>\n<h2>•   矮椅方塊</h2>\n<p><em>與椅子方塊相同，但沒有椅腿</em> </p>\n<p><em>可由 1 個染色羊毛和 2 個木製階梯合成，或由 1 個染色坐墊和 1 個木製階梯合成</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RHyNcbG/Untitled.png\" alt=\"chair_colors\"></p>\n<h2>•   海帶坐墊</h2>\n<p><em>比羊毛椅子更便宜且更容易種植的替代品</em></p>\n<p><em>可由 1 個乾海帶物品和 1 個木製階梯合成</em></p>\n<p><em>運作方式與 Create 的坐墊方塊完全相同</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zb4mnhW/kelp-seat.png\" alt=\"kelp_seat\"></p>\n<h2>•   海帶椅</h2>\n<p><em>比羊毛坐墊更便宜且更容易種植的替代品</em></p>\n<p><em>可由 1 個乾海帶和 2 個木製階梯合成，或由 1 個海帶坐墊方塊和 1 個木製階梯合成</em></p>\n<p><em>運作方式與彩色椅子完全相同</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/71FCSBf/resized-kelp-chair.gif\" alt=\"kelp_armrests\"></p>\n<h2>•   海帶矮椅</h2>\n<h2>•   坐樹木板</h2>\n<p><em>與複製貓階梯和複製貓面板搭配使用，作為坐墊和椅子的裝飾</em></p>\n<p><em>3 個坐樹木板可由 2 個木製階梯和 2 個木板合成</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rm5scrg/seatwood.png\" alt=\"seatwood\"></p>\n<h2>貢獻者！</h2>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lopyluna/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Luna</a> 提供的精美標誌 :)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/AsseyGithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@AsseyGithub</a> 將 Create: Interiors 翻譯為韓文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/rim4oo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@rim4oo</a> 將 Create: Interiors 翻譯為俄文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p>## </p>\n<h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finteriors%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上找到 Create: Interiors</h3>\n<h4><a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此處</a> 報告問題</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/Q8SRA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VpBf0xs/interiors.png\" alt=\"Interiors Banner\"></a></p>",
